2. Class: PUEXEngine

The core simulation object.

Constructor

PUEXEngine(
    nx=32,
    ny=32,
    burst_mult=2.0,
    node_positions=None
)

Parameters

nx, ny — geometry grid dimensions

burst_mult — gamma‑ray burst amplitude multiplier

node_positions — optional custom node placement list

Attributes

X — geometry field

nodes — list of heavy‑element reaction nodes

tensors — tensor fields (xi, lambda_val, eta)

ledger — immutable event chain

time_history — simulation timestamps

peak_X_history — geometry amplitude log

event_timestamps — event occurrence times

